When called interactively with a prefix argument, prompt for
UPSTREAM-LOCATION, which should be a remote branch name.

(fn &optional UPSTREAM-LOCATION)" t nil)
(autoload 'vc-root-log-unintegrated "vc" "Show log of revisions since the merge base with UPSTREAM-LOCATION.
